    "expectedRule": "Chapter 14 splices three genes at three consoles. Genesis serum is kept on two tracks (run loot bag and hub inventory) and a reward or drop adds to both: genesis_gate gives 2, each splice console 1 and a won gene_stalker fight drops 1. The first clear of a console leaves a pending splice that blocks leaving with `原型拼接尚未完成，请先选择武力、术法、守御或复生基因。`; law/resolve-genesis-splice costs as many serum as copies of that gene already spliced (no entry gear discounts), taken from both tracks; with nothing pending it changes nothing and is refused. Outside and inside the boss fight every spliced gene gives the player +4% (sealed) of its kind: force/art outgoing damage, guard effect or healing; in the boss encounter a gene spliced at least twice also strengthens the boss (force: +8% defense, sealed). Display: title 众生原型拼接, severity resolved once three are spliced or frozen, danger while pending, otherwise warning; meter {spliced, 3}. Gates: genesis_force_* need force spliced twice (`力之原型需专精至少2次后开放。`), genesis_mosaic_* need three different genes (`完成三次拼接且选择三种互异原型后开放。`), the boss approaches need three splices (`完成三次拼接后，原型馆长入口才会开放。`). Selecting the boss freezes the sequence. The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
